110
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:13,280
But now you can cover your plagiarizing pretty quickly.

111
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:27,200
So one of the concerns of the Vatican, which heads all universities that have a Catholic name on them are under the auspices, general auspices of the Dicastry for Education at the Vatican.

112
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:31,520
And it tries to oversee and promote certain aspects of education.

113
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:35,120
