00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:53,440
Well, the council having only one sentence said, heretic, gone, done.

138
00:13:54,800 --> 00:14:09,040
Having now resource to all of his stuff, the churches, as it were, reintegrated in Astoria into the orthodox community, the warm relations between the churches that were that considered themselves Astoria churches and all that.

139
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:14,080
Well, that's a research that you can do quickly will through all of his literature arrive at something.

