00:14:14,400 --> 00:14:16,400
We had another girl here from Syria.

141
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:33,600
She was studying manuscripts and she discovered that one manuscript that had been attributed to a certain author could not have been his, it had to be someone else, and she could tell by the quality of the language and then even date things within the text.

142
00:14:34,560 --> 00:14:45,280
Well, again, it was the digitized process that allowed her to see that quickly, rather than having to read through 400 books and go to Paris and go to different countries and compare the volumes.

