174
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:30,000
And I still consider this a kind of a proof of concept.

175
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:40,640
And the idea is that we're going to have a webcam on the studio so people can actually watch the books being scanned and hopefully we'll have an inventory so people can kind of check where their book is in the scanning queue and see when it's going to be scanned.

176
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,760
And we think that'll be kind of fun.

177
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:46,880
But the idea is we want to show people what this process consists of and get them excited about it.

178
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:56,800
